=== COMPILER2 DIAGNOSTICS ===
  [hir] E0010

  ⚠ `${...}` in a quoted prompt is sent to the model as literal text — `"..."` strings do not interpolate. Use a backtick prompt to interpolate, or write `\${...}` in a backtick prompt to keep the
  │ literal `${`.
    ╭─[main.baml:17:86]
 17 │   prompt: "Write one sentence. Escapes decode:\n\tdone. Interpolation stays literal: ${topic}"
    ·                                                                                      ─┬
    ·                                                                                       ╰── literal text here, not an interpolation
    ╰────
